  id: Forest_Lighthouse_1
  headerName: Notice!
  content: "\tTo whoever reaches this place:\r\n\r\n\tThe evacuation center has moved.
    We have received reports that this location is itself on the verge of collapse.
    We are relocating to ground that is still stable. If you are alive and you find
    this notice, follow us as quickly as you can.\n\r\n\tHere is where we are going:\r\n\t[Map
    attached]"
